{{- /*
Red, and NOTICE shape — a form with no button slot and no URL box, so it cannot
be given a link even by a caller that passes one. This message goes to the
address being moved AWAY from, and its reader may be someone whose account is
being taken: "click here to stop it" is exactly the sentence an attacker would
forge, so the real message never contains one. Same rule as session_revoked.
*/ -}}
{{- define "email_change_notice" -}}
{{- template "chrome.shape_notice" (dict "Doc" . "Accent" "#c0392f" "Tint" "#fdeeec") -}}
{{- end -}}
